        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6-1-9 The task force shall submit a written report to JCEA and the District. Any recommendation(s) not accepted and/or implemented prior to the next succeeding series of negotiations shall be subject to negotia-tions annually unless otherwise mutually agreed to by the parties. The parties shall notify each other in writing of their action on the report in a timely fashion.",
